          "ruleId": "release-scope-claim-contradicted",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "evidence/release/0.70.3/RELEASE-NOTES-0.70.3.md lines 3-5 say the published-path diff against v0.70.2 is the #4918 fix files plus the version bump, and nothing else. At this head git diff --name-only v0.70.2 HEAD -- crates src lists 68 files (65 at 4715d5e1c4); the 3 new ones are crates/aprender-gpu/src/kernels/gdn/{decode_attention,decode_attention_split,delta_rule_scan}.rs from d78c30c9cc (six #[ignore] attributes, test-only code, flake #4956). The notes were not updated and do not mention aprender-gpu or #4956."
          },
